    the visitor (controllers/authLinkController.js). %>
<div class="container my-4">
  <h1 class="h4">Your login isn't linked to a player yet</h1>
  <p>
    Stats are shown for your own club, so we need to know which player you are first.
    Ask the results secretary through the <a href="/contact-us">contact form</a> to link
    your login, and say which club you play for.
  </p>
</div>

